<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Elders year net profit falls 3.3 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Elders year net profit falls 3.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    15.91 vs 15.27</p>
<p>    Net				     14.05 vs 14.52</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Elders Australia Ltd is a pastoral group and is currently under takeover by major shareholder Futuris Corp Ltd which is offering 10 of its shares for every nine Elders shares plus 23 cents per Elders share.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     4.00 vs 8.00</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			2.94 vs 2.95</p>
<p>    Other income			  62.52 vs 41.99</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.80 vs 14.70</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 1.00 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					0.77 vs 0.51</p>
<p>    Interest				39.50 vs 17.96</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   8.84 vs 5.87</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.09 vs 0.24</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
